                "message": "Skip spacious-padding on tty frames\n\nspacious-padding-set-faces builds :underline (:color unspecified ...)\nfor header-line-inactive when the frame has no color information,\nwhich signals an error inside make-frame and makes the server drop\nthe new emacsclient frame.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G1V2dppJWyRgELZAAtdqE5",
                "tree": {
